# Allow list: only what the web image build needs enters the build context (Dockerfile). Anything
# else, such as .env files and IDE folders, stays out without having to list it.
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!tsconfig.base.json
!nginx.conf
!apps/web/
!apps/mobile/package.json
!packages/
# Inside the allowed folders: installed dependencies, build output and the base map, which the
# deployment Compose mounts from a volume instead.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.env*
apps/web/public/tiles
